WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:02.754
(dramatic music)

00:00:02.754 --> 00:00:04.837
(whoosh)

00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:11.266
(booming)

00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:13.710
(clicking)

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:15.960
(whirring)

00:00:18.796 --> 00:00:21.733
(sentimental music)

00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:24.080
(cooing)

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.330
- Why aren't there any
more children, Mother?

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.480
- There used to be.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.053
- Why did you only make one?

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.030
- Mothers need time to learn.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.820
This facility was designed to
give humanity a second chance.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.574
One that began with you.

00:00:40.574 --> 00:00:42.490
(dramatic music)

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:43.323
Daughter.

00:00:47.403 --> 00:00:49.163
The path will not be easy.

00:00:50.898 --> 00:00:52.753
The world outside is lifeless.

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:55.960
But I made you into
the woman that you are.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:58.468
So that we could do this together.

00:00:58.468 --> 00:01:00.718
(whirring)

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.488
- Mother?

00:01:05.488 --> 00:01:06.960
(alarm wailing)

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.037
- Hey!

00:01:08.037 --> 00:01:09.204
Open the door!

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.150
(dramatic music)

00:01:19.304 --> 00:01:20.580
- How are you unaffected?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.530
By the contagion outside?

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:23.930
- Who put that in your head?

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.890
- Did you know there
were people out there?

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.190
- I'm as surprised as you.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:34.600
- There's a droid here?

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:36.000
- Mother's not what you think.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.292
She's taken care of me my whole life.

00:01:38.292 --> 00:01:40.479
- You haven't seen what they've done.

00:01:40.479 --> 00:01:42.029
- Not Mother.

00:01:42.029 --> 00:01:45.020
(dramatic music)

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:46.953
- I told you it was dangerous outside.

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:52.130
- I hope you see that I'm
different than her assailants.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.850
- That thing feels nothing for you.

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.603
You don't belong here.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.400
- I've discovered something troubling.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.920
Our guest has not been
entirely truthful with us.

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:07.600
Daughter.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.270
I know you're frightened
but you have no need to be.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.040
Have I ever done you harm?

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.316
- It's just a matter of time.

00:02:13.316 --> 00:02:14.149
Time now.

00:02:14.149 --> 00:02:16.860
- This woman doesn't care
about any future but her own.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:17.693
Her own.

00:02:17.693 --> 00:02:18.920
She's very dangerous.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:19.753
Dangerous.

00:02:19.753 --> 00:02:20.586
- I'm never gonna hurt you.

00:02:20.586 --> 00:02:21.419
Hurt you.

00:02:21.419 --> 00:02:22.379
- She's a risk we can't take.

00:02:22.379 --> 00:02:23.212
Can't take.

00:02:23.212 --> 00:02:24.620
- We need to go now.

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:25.453
- Trust me.

00:02:25.453 --> 00:02:26.286
- Trust me.

00:02:26.286 --> 00:02:27.119
- Trust me.

00:02:27.119 --> 00:02:28.540
- Mother!

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.180
- Daughter.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.894
Your whole life I've taught
you to see the bigger picture.

00:02:32.894 --> 00:02:35.644
(dramatic music)

00:02:38.201 --> 00:02:40.143
Everything I do is to protect you.

